  "job_B3.3.12_20251003_114654": {
    "chunk_text": "an Eala men \u00fea leofoston, hu \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s weallende spelboda & unge\u00feyldig heretoga, se \u00fee \u00e6r \u00feone H\u00e6lend & he \u00e6r to \u00feam cyninge becom & w\u00e6pn gegrap mid to campienne, \u00e6r\u00feon \u00fee he to his lichoman & he \u00e6r \u00feone fe\u00fean sohte, \u00e6r\u00feon \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6t leoht gesawe. & he swa on \u00fe\u00e6re his gebyrde oferswi\u00fede ealle \u00e6 \u00feisse menniscan gebyrde. Uton we gesceawian \u00fea healican gewyrhto Sancte Iohannes se \u00fe\u00e6re modor inno\u00feas ongean \u00feam & \u00feeah he \u00fea get latode on \u00feissum lichomlicum gebyrde, hw\u00e6\u00fere he on \u00fe\u00e6m gaste anum \u00fe\u00e6s & sona swa he acenned w\u00e6s & geboren, he \u00feam f\u00e6der \u00fea stefne ageaf & \u00fea tungan onlysde, \u00fea se Mycel is \u00feonne \u00feeos weor\u00feung \u00fe\u00e6s halgan Sancte Iohannes gebyrde, & eal rihtgelyfed folc sceal Mycel is se haligdom & seo weor\u00feung Sancte Iohannes \u00fe\u00e6s mycelnesse se H\u00e6lend Drihten sylfa tacn Selfa se w\u00e6s butan menniscan f\u00e6der fram unwemre f\u00e6mnan acenned. Sanctus Iohannes \u00feonne g\u00e6\u00fe beforan eallum o\u00ferum witgan, & ealra o\u00feerra heahf\u00e6dera m\u00e6gen he & eallum Godes halgum he is sigef\u00e6stra & gecorenra. & eall \u00feeos mennisce gebyrd Sancte Iohanne bedyrned is. Hw\u00e6t we gehyrdon, \u00fea \u00fea Esaias se witga r\u00e6den w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t se Halga Gast swa \u00fe",
